​‍‍​​‍​‍​‍‍‍‍​​‍​‍​​‍​‍​​‍​​​​‍​​‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍​​​‍​​​‍​​​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍​‍​‍​​‍‍‍​​​​​​‍‍​‍‍‍​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍​‍​‍‍​‍‍‍‍​​​​‍‍​‍​​​​‍​‍‍​​‍​‍‍​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍‍‍​​‍‍​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍​‍​‍​​‍‍​‍‍‍‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍‍​​‍‍​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍‍‍​​‍‍‍​‍‍​​‍‍​​​‍​​‍‍​‍‍‍​​‍​‍​​‍​​‍‍​‍‍​​​‍‍​​​‍​​‍‍​‍‍‍​​‍​‍​​‍​​‍​‍​​​‍​‍‍​​​‍‍​‍‍​‍‍​‍​​‍‍‍​​‍​‍‍​‍​‍‍​‍‍​​‍​​​‍​‍​‍‍‍​‍​​‍‍‍​​‍‍​‍‍​​​‍‍​​​‍‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​​‍​​‍​​‍‍​‍‍​​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍​‍​‍​​‍​​​​​‍​‍‍‍​‍‍‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​‍​​​‍​​​‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​‍​​​‍​​​‍​‍​‍‍‍‍​​​​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​​​‍​​​‍​​​‍​‍​‍‍‍​‍‍‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍‍​‍​‍‍​​‍‍​​​‍​‍​​​​‍​​‍​‍​​‍​​‍​​​‍​​​‍​‍​‍​‍​​‍‍​​​‍​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍​‍​‍​​​‍‍​‍‍​​​‍​​‍​​‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​​​‍​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍​‍‍‍‍​​​​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​​​‍​​​‍​​​​​‍​‍‍‍​‍‍‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍‍​​‍‍​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍​‍‍​​​‍​​​​‍​​‍‍‍‍​​‍​‍‍​​​‍​​​‍‍​​‍​​‍​‍​​‍​​​‍‍​​​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍​​‍‍​​‍​​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍​​‍​‍​​‍​‍​​‍​​‍​​​​‍‍​‍​​‍​​‍​​‍‍​‍‍​​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍​‍‍​‍​‍​​‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​‍​​​‍​‍​‍​‍​‍‍‍‍​‍​​‍​​‍‍​‍​​‍‍​​‍​​‍​‍​​‍​​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​​‍‍​​​‍​‍​‍​​​‍​​​‍​‍​​‍‍​​‍​​‍​​‍‍‍‍​‍​‍​‍​​​‍​​​‍​‍​‍‍‍​‍​​​‍​​‍‍‍​​‍​​​‍‍‍​‍​‍​​​‍​‍‍‍‍​​​​‍​​‍‍‍​​‍​​​​‍‍​​‍‍​​​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍​‍​‍​‍‍‍​‍​‍​‍​‍​‍‍‍‍​​‍​‍​​‍‍​​​‍​‍​‍​​​‍​​​‍​‍​​‍‍​​‍​​‍​​‍‍‍​​‍​​​‍‍‍​‍​​‍‍‍​​‍‍​‍‍​​​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​‍‍‍​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​​‍‍‍‍​‍​‍​‍‍‍​‍​​​‍‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​​‍​‍‍​​‍​‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍‍​​‍‍​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍​‍‍​​​‍​​‍​‍​​‍‍​‍‍​​​‍‍​​​‍‍​​‍‍​​‍​​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍‍‍‍​​‍​‍‍​​‍​​​‍‍​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍‍​‍​‍‍​‍​‍​​​‍​​‍‍​​‍​​​‍‍‍​​‍​‍‍​‍​‍‍​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​‍​​​‍​​​‍​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​​‍‍‍‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​​‍​​‍​​‍‍​​​​​‍​​‍‍‍‍​‍​‍​‍‍‍​‍​​​‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​​​‍​​‍‍‍​​​‍‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍​​‍​​‍‍​‍​​​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​​​​‍‍​​‍‍​​​​​​‍‍​‍​​​‍​‍‍​​‍​‍‍​‍​‍​​‍‍​‍‍​​​‍‍​‍‍​​​‍​​‍‍​​​‍​‍​‍​​​‍​‍​​​‍​​‍‍​​‍‍​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍‍​‍‍​‍​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍‍​‍​​​‍​​‍‍‍‍​‍​‍​‍​​​‍‍​‍​‍‍​‍‍‍‍​‍​​‍​​‍‍‍​​‍​​​​‍‍​​‍‍​​​​​​‍‍​‍​​​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​​‍‍‍‍​‍​‍​‍‍‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​​‍‍​​‍‍​‍​​‍‍‍‍​‍​​​‍​​​‍‍​‍‍​​​‍‍​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​‍‍‍​‍​‍‍​​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​​‍‍​​​‍​​​​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​​‍​​​‍​​​‍‍​​​‍​​​‍‍​​‍​​​‍‍​‍​‍​​‍‍​​​​​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​‍‍‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​​‍‍​​​​​‍​‍​‍​‍​‍​​‍​​​​‍​​‍​‍​​‍‍‍​‍‍​​‍‍​​​‍‍​‍​​​‍‍‍​‍​​​‍‍​​‍‍​‍‍‍​​‍​‍‍​​‍​‍​‍‍​​​​‍​‍​​‍​​‍‍‍​‍‍​​‍‍​​​‍‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​​‍​​‍​​‍‍​‍‍​​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍​‍​‍​​‍​​​​​‍​‍‍‍​‍‍‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​‍​​​‍​​​‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​‍​​​‍​​​‍​‍​‍‍‍‍​​​​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​​​‍​​​‍​​​‍​‍​‍‍‍​‍‍‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍‍​‍​‍‍​​‍‍​​​‍​‍​​​​‍​​‍​‍​​‍​​‍​​​‍​​​‍​‍​‍​‍​​‍‍​​​‍​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍​‍​‍​​​‍‍​‍‍​​​‍​​‍​​‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​​​‍​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍​‍‍‍‍​​​​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​​​‍​​​‍​​​​​‍​‍‍‍​‍‍‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍‍​​‍‍​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍​‍‍​​​‍​​​​‍​​‍‍‍‍​​‍​‍‍​​​‍​​​‍‍​​‍‍​‍​​​​‍​​‍‍​‍​​​​‍​‍‍​‍​​​‍‍​​‍​​‍​​​‍‍​​​‍‍​​​​​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​‍​‍​‍‍​‍‍​​​‍​​​‍​‍​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍​‍​‍​​‍‍​‍‍‍‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍​‍‍​‍‍​‍​‍​​‍‍‍​​‍‍​‍‍​​​‍​​‍‍‍​​‍​‍​‍​​​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍‍‍‍​‍​​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​​​‍‍‍​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍‍​‍​​​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​‍​​​‍​‍‍​​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​​‍‍​​‍‍​​​​​​‍‍​​​​​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​​​‍​​​‍​​​‍​‍​​‍‍​​​​​‍​​‍‍​​​‍​‍​‍‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​​​​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​‍​​​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍‍​‍​​​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​‍​​​‍​‍‍​​‍​​‍‍​​​​​‍​‍‍​​‍​​‍‍​​‍​​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍‍​‍‍​​​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​‍‍‍​‍​​‍​​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍​‍​‍​‍‍‍​‍​​‍‍‍​​‍‍​‍​​​​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍‍‍​‍‍‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​‍​‍​‍​‍‍​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍‍‍‍​‍​​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍‍​​​​‍​​‍​‍​​​‍‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​‍‍‍​‍​‍​​‍​​‍​​​‍​​​‍‍​​​‍​​​‍‍​​‍​​‍​‍​​‍​​‍‍​‍‍​​​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​​‍​​‍​​‍‍​‍‍​​‍​​‍​​‍​‍‍​‍​‍​​‍​‍​​​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍​‍​‍​‍​​​‍‍​​‍‍‍​​‍‍​​‍‍​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​​‍‍​​‍‍‍​‍‍‍​‍‍‍​‍​​‍‍​​​‍​‍​‍​​​‍‍​‍​​​​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​​‍‍‍‍​‍​‍​‍‍‍​‍​‍​‍​‍​‍‍‍​‍​​​‍​​‍‍‍​​‍​​​‍​​​‍‍​​‍​​​‍‍​‍‍​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍​​‍‍​​​​​​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​​‍‍‍‍​‍​‍​‍​​​‍​​‍‍​‍​​‍‍​​​​​‍​​‍‍​​​‍​‍​‍​​​‍‍​‍​​​​‍‍​‍‍​‍​‍​​‍‍‍​​‍​‍​‍‍‍​‍​​‍​​‍​​‍‍​‍​‍​‍​‍‍​​‍​‍‍‍‍​‍​​‍‍​​​‍‍​​‍‍​‍​​​‍​​‍‍‍‍​‍​‍​‍‍‍​‍​‍​​​‍​‍‍‍‍​​​​‍​‍‍​‍​​‍‍​‍​​‍​‍​​‍​‍​​​‍‍‍​​‍​‍‍​​‍‍​​‍​‍​​​‍​​‍‍‍‍​‍​​‍‍‍‍​‍<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>OpsCenter v3.18.0 运维工作台</title>
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><text y='.9em' font-size='90'>🛡️</text></svg>">
<script src="https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.global.prod.js"></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/xterm/xterm.min.css">
<script src="/assets/xterm/xterm.min.js"></script>
<script src="/assets/xterm/xterm-addon-fit.min.js"></script>
<script src="/assets/xterm/xterm-addon-web-links.min.js"></script>
<style>
:root{--bg:#0d1117;--bg2:#161b22;--card:#1c2330;--card-hover:#243447;--border:#30363d;--text1:#e6edf3;--text2:#8b949e;--accent:#2dd4bf;--accent2:#0d9488;--green:#22c55e;--orange:#f59e0b;--red:#ef4444;--purple:#8b5cf6;--blue:#3b82f6;--radius:10px;--sidebar-w:220px}
.light{--bg:#f0f2f5;--bg2:#fff;--card:#fff;--card-hover:#f5f5f5;--border:#e5e7eb;--text1:#1f2937;--text2:#6b7280}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{height:100%;font-family:-apple-system,"Microsoft YaHei","PingFang SC",system-ui,sans-serif}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text1);transition:background .3s,color .3s}
::-webkit-scrollbar{width:6px;height:6px}
::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:transparent}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--border);border-radius:3px}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover{background:var(--text2)}

/* ===== Layout ===== */
.app{display:flex;min-height:100vh}
.sidebar{width:var(--sidebar-w);background:var(--bg2);border-right:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:fixed;top:0;left:0;height:100vh;z-index:40;transition:width .2s}
.sidebar.collapsed{width:60px}
.sidebar.collapsed .logo-text,.sidebar.collapsed .nav-item span:not(.nav-icon),.sidebar.collapsed .nav-section-title,.sidebar.collapsed .sidebar-footer-text{display:none}
.sidebar.collapsed .nav-item{justify-content:center}
.sidebar-logo{padding:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.sidebar-logo .logo-icon{width:34px;height:34px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0d1117;flex-shrink:0}
.sidebar-logo .logo-text{font-size:14px;font-weight:600}
.sidebar-logo .logo-text small{color:var(--text2);display:block;font-size:10px;font-weight:400}
.sidebar-nav{padding:10px 8px;flex:1;overflow-y:auto}
.nav-section-title{font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;padding:4px 12px;margin-bottom:4px}
.nav-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);transition:all .15s;margin-bottom:2px}
.nav-item:hover{background:var(--card);color:var(--text1)}
.nav-item.active{background:rgba(45,212,191,.12);color:var(--accent);font-weight:500}
.nav-item .nav-icon{width:18px;height:18px;flex-shrink:0}
.sidebar-footer{padding:10px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.sidebar-footer .online-dot{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);margin-right:5px;box-shadow:0 0 5px var(--green)}
.sidebar-footer-text{font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)}

/* Main */
.main{margin-left:var(--sidebar-w);flex:1;min-width:0;transition:margin-left .2s}
.main.expanded{margin-left:60px}
.topbar{background:var(--bg2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:12px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:30}
.topbar-left{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
.topbar h2{font-size:16px;font-weight:600}
.topbar-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.search-box{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:13px}
.search-box input{background:none;border:none;outline:none;color:var(--text1);font-size:13px;width:160px}
.search-box svg{width:14px;height:14px;color:var(--text2)}
.clock{font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.icon-btn{background:none;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 8px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--text2);display:flex;align-items:center;transition:all .15s}
.icon-btn:hover{color:var(--text1);border-color:var(--accent)}

/* Content */
.content{padding:20px 24px}
.stat-row{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.stat-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:14px 18px;flex:1;min-width:120px}
.stat-card .num{font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1}
.stat-card .label{font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:4px}
.stat-card.green .num{color:var(--green)}
.stat-card.red .num{color:var(--red)}
.stat-card.blue .num{color:var(--blue)}
.stat-card.purple .num{color:var(--purple)}
.stat-card.orange .num{color:var(--orange)}
.stat-card.teal .num{color:var(--accent)}


/* ===== Server Tab Bar ===== */
.server-tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.server-tab{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--card);cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);transition:all .15s}
.server-tab:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--text1)}
.server-tab.active{background:rgba(45,212,191,.12);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);font-weight:500}
.server-tab .st-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0}
.server-tab .st-dot.online{background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 4px var(--green)}
.server-tab .st-dot.offline{background:var(--red);box-shadow:0 0 4px var(--red)}
.server-tab .st-count{font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg);margin-left:4px}

/* ===== Group Filter Chips ===== */
.group-filter-bar{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
.group-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--card);cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);transition:all .15s;user-select:none}
.group-chip:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--text1)}
.group-chip.active{color:#0d1117;font-weight:500}
.chip-count{font-size:11px;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text2)}
.group-chip.active .chip-count{background:rgba(0,0,0,.15);color:#0d1117}
.chip-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0}
.server-filter-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:6px}

/* ===== Service Group ===== */
.group-section{margin-bottom:24px}
.group-header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;cursor:pointer;padding:8px 0}
.group-header .group-dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:3px;flex-shrink:0}
.group-header .group-name{font-size:15px;font-weight:600}
.group-header .group-count{font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);background:var(--bg2);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px}
.group-header .group-actions{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:4px}
.group-header .group-actions button{background:none;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s}
.group-header .group-actions button:hover{color:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent)}

.svc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:12px}
.svc-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px;transition:all .2s;position:relative}
.svc-card:hover{border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(45,212,191,.08);cursor:pointer;transform:translateY(-1px)}
.svc-card-top{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px}
.svc-name{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.svc-name .status-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;display:inline-block}
.svc-name .status-dot.online{background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--green)}
.svc-name .status-dot.offline{background:var(--red);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--red)}
.svc-name .status-dot.unknown{background:var(--orange)}
.svc-name .status-dot.server_offline{background:var(--orange);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--orange)}
.svc-name .status-dot.checking{background:var(--blue);animation:pulse 1s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.3}}
.svc-badge{font-size:10px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:500}
.svc-badge.auto{background:rgba(59,130,246,.15);color:var(--blue)}
.svc-badge.srv-offline{background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:var(--orange)}
.svc-desc{font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:6px}
.svc-tags{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px}
.svc-tag{font-size:10px;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--bg2);color:var(--text2);border:1px solid var(--border)}
.svc-url{font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:8px;word-break:break-all;font-family:monospace}
.svc-url a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none}
.svc-url a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.svc-footer{margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
    .btn-sm{font-size:11px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:none;color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}
.btn-sm:hover{color:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent)}
.btn-sm.primary{background:var(--accent);color:#0d1117;border-color:var(--accent);font-weight:500}
.btn-sm.primary:hover{background:var(--accent2)}
.btn-sm.danger{color:var(--red);border-color:var(--red)}
.btn-sm.danger:hover{background:rgba(239,68,68,.1)}
.svc-move-select{font-size:11px;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg2);color:var(--text1);cursor:pointer}
.svc-server-info{font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}

/* ===== Group Management Modal ===== */
.modal-overlay{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.5);z-index:100;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.modal{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:24px;min-width:460px;max-width:90vw;max-height:80vh;overflow-y:auto}
.modal h3{font-size:16px;margin-bottom:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.modal-row{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px}
.modal-row label{font-size:13px;min-width:70px;color:var(--text2)}
.modal-row input,.modal-row select{flex:1;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--card);color:var(--text1);font-size:13px}
.modal-row input:focus,.modal-row select:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--accent)}
.group-list-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:6px;background:var(--card)}
.group-list-item .g-dot{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;flex-shrink:0}
.group-list-item .g-name{font-size:13px;font-weight:500}
.group-list-item .g-order{font-size:11px;color:var(--text2)}
.group-list-item .g-btns{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:4px}
.modal-footer{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px;margin-top:16px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}

/* ===== Monitor Page ===== */
.mon-offline{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:80px 20px;gap:12px}
    .offline-icon{font-size:48px;opacity:0.6}
    .offline-text{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text1)}
    .offline-sub{font-size:13px;color:var(--text2)}
    .mon-status.offline{color:var(--red)}
    .mon-header{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px 20px;margin-bottom:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.mon-header-left{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-width:200px}
.mon-header-left select{padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg2);color:var(--text1);font-size:13px;font-weight:500}
.mon-header-left .mon-status{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2)}
.mon-header-left .mon-status .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--green)}
.mon-header-right{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;flex:1}
.mon-tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);white-space:nowrap}
.mon-tag .tag-label{color:var(--text2)}
.mon-tag .tag-val{color:var(--text1);font-weight:500;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.mon-metrics{margin-bottom:16px}
.mon-metrics-row{display:grid;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px}
.mon-metrics-row.primary{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
.mon-metrics-row.secondary{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(180px,1fr))}
.metric-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.metric-card:hover{border-color:var(--accent);transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}
.metric-card.active{border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(45,212,191,.18)}
.metric-card .mc-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:8px}
.metric-card .mc-icon{font-size:20px}
.metric-card .mc-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px}
.metric-card .mc-value{font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1}
.metric-card .mc-bar{height:4px;background:var(--border);border-radius:2px;margin-top:10px;overflow:hidden}
.metric-card .mc-bar-fill{height:100%;border-radius:2px;transition:width .5s}
.metric-card .mc-detail{font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:6px}
.chart-section{margin-bottom:20px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px}
.chart-header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
.chart-header .ch-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:600}
.chart-metric-tabs{display:flex;gap:4px}
.chart-metric-tabs button{font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:none;color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s}
.chart-metric-tabs button.active{background:var(--accent);color:#0d1117;border-color:var(--accent);font-weight:500}
.chart-time-tabs{display:flex;gap:4px}
.chart-time-tabs button{font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:none;color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s}
.chart-time-tabs button.active{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;border-color:var(--blue)}
.chart-container{height:280px;position:relative}
.container-table{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:auto;max-height:400px}
.container-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px}
.container-table th{background:var(--bg2);padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;font-weight:500;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1}
.container-table td{padding:7px 12px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.running-dot{color:var(--green);font-weight:700}


/* ===== Resources Page ===== */
.server-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:12px}
.server-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:0;overflow:hidden;transition:border-color .2s}
.server-card:hover{border-color:rgba(45,212,191,.3)}
.server-card .sc-header{padding:16px 20px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(45,212,191,.04),transparent)}
.server-card .sc-title{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:1;min-width:0}
.server-card .sc-title h4{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.server-card .sc-body{padding:16px 20px 20px}
.sc-info{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px 20px;margin-bottom:14px}
.sc-info-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px}
.sc-info-label{color:var(--text2);white-space:nowrap;min-width:32px}
.sc-info-val{color:var(--text1);font-weight:500;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.sc-badge{font-size:10px;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap}
.sc-badge.online{background:rgba(34,197,94,.12);color:var(--green)}
.sc-badge.offline{background:rgba(239,68,68,.12);color:var(--red)}
.sc-badge.ok{background:rgba(34,197,94,.08);color:var(--green)}
.sc-badge.warn{background:rgba(245,158,11,.08);color:var(--orange)}
.agent-tag{font-size:10px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:500;margin-left:4px;white-space:nowrap}
.agent-tag.running{background:rgba(34,197,94,.12);color:#22c55e}
.agent-tag.not_deployed{background:rgba(139,148,158,.12);color:#8b949e}
.agent-tag.deploying{background:rgba(245,158,11,.12);color:#f59e0b}
.agent-tag.stopped{background:rgba(239,68,68,.12);color:#ef4444}
.agent-tag.error{background:rgba(239,68,68,.12);color:#ef4444}
.agent-tag.local{background:rgba(45,212,191,.12);color:var(--accent)}
.btn-deploy-agent{font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--accent);color:var(--accent);background:transparent;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s}
.btn-deploy-agent:hover{background:var(--accent);color:#0d1117}
.btn-deploy-agent:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}
.deploy-auto-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:10px 0;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(45,212,191,.06);border:1px solid rgba(45,212,191,.2)}
.deploy-auto-row label{font-size:13px;color:var(--text1);cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.deploy-auto-row input[type=checkbox]{accent-color:var(--accent)}
.deploy-info{font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:2px}
.srv-btn-row,.sc-btn-row{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px;padding-bottom:14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
/* Service list */
.svc-list-header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:10px}
.svc-list-title{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.8px}
.svc-list{margin-top:0}
.svc-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 10px;font-size:12px;border-radius:8px;transition:background .12s;margin-bottom:1px}
.svc-item:hover{background:rgba(45,212,191,.04)}
.svc-item.hidden-svc{opacity:.4}
.svc-item .svc-name{flex:0 0 auto;min-width:80px;max-width:140px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--text1);font-weight:500;font-size:13px}
.svc-item .svc-cat{font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);background:rgba(100,116,139,.1);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0}
.svc-tag{font-size:10px;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;border:none;font-weight:500}
.svc-tag.vis{background:rgba(34,197,94,.1);color:var(--green)}
.svc-tag.hid{background:rgba(239,68,68,.1);color:var(--red)}
.svc-edit-btn{background:none;border:none;color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;padding:2px 4px;font-size:12px;border-radius:4px;transition:all .15s}
.svc-edit-btn:hover{color:var(--accent);background:rgba(100,116,139,.1)}
.svc-move-select{font-size:10px;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg2);color:var(--text1);cursor:pointer;max-width:80px}
.svc-count{font-size:11px;color:var(--text2);margin-bottom:2px}
/* ===== Service Credentials ===== */
.svc-creds{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;flex:1;min-width:0}
.svc-cred{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-size:11px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(45,212,191,.05);border:1px solid rgba(45,212,191,.15);transition:border-color .15s}
.svc-cred:hover{border-color:rgba(45,212,191,.35)}
.svc-cred .cred-icon{width:12px;height:12px;color:var(--accent);flex-shrink:0;vertical-align:middle}
.svc-cred .cred-label{color:var(--text2);font-size:10px;margin-right:1px}
.svc-cred .cred-val{color:var(--text1);font-family:Consolas,monospace;max-width:120px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.svc-cred .cred-copy{background:none;border:none;color:var(--text2);cursor:pointer;padding:0 2px;font-size:10px;border-radius:3px;transition:color .15s;line-height:1}
.svc-cred .cred-copy:hover{color:var(--accent)}
.svc-cred-empty{font-size:10px;color:var(--text2);opacity:.4;font-style:italic;padding:2px 4px}
.svc-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;flex-shrink:0}
/* ===== Resource Server Tabs ===== */
.res-server-tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.res-server-tab{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--card);cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);transition:all .15s;min-width:140px}
.res-server-tab:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--text1);background:rgba(45,212,191,.04)}
.res-server-tab.active{background:rgba(45,212,191,.1);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(45,212,191,.15)}
.res-server-tab .rst-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0}
.res-server-tab .rst-dot.online{background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 4px var(--green)}
.res-server-tab .rst-dot.offline{background:var(--red);box-shadow:0 0 4px var(--red)}
.res-server-tab .rst-info{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
.res-server-tab .rst-name{font-weight:500}
.res-server-tab .rst-detail{font-size:10px;color:var(--text2)}

/* ===== Responsive ===== */
@media(max-width:768px){.sidebar{width:60px}.sidebar .logo-text,.sidebar .nav-item span:not(.nav-icon),.sidebar .nav-section-title,.sidebar .sidebar-footer-text{display:none}.main{margin-left:60px}.svc-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.stat-card{min-width:100px}}
.toast-wrap{position:fixed;top:16px;right:16px;z-index:9999;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;pointer-events:none}
.toast-msg{padding:10px 18px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;color:#fff;opacity:0;transform:translateX(30px);transition:all .3s;pointer-events:auto;max-width:360px}
.toast-msg.show{opacity:1;transform:translateX(0)}
.toast-msg.info{background:rgba(45,212,191,.92)}.toast-msg.ok{background:rgba(34,197,94,.92)}.toast-msg.warn{background:rgba(245,158,11,.92)}.toast-msg.err{background:rgba(239,68,68,.92)}

/* Terminal Page */
.term-page{display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:calc(100vh - 60px);overflow:hidden}
.term-tabs{display:flex;align-items:center;background:var(--bg2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:0 8px;gap:2px;min-height:38px;flex-shrink:0}
.term-tab{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);background:transparent;border:1px solid transparent;border-bottom:none;transition:all .15s;max-width:160px}
.term-tab:hover{background:var(--card);color:var(--text1)}
.term-tab.active{background:var(--card);color:var(--accent);border-color:var(--border)}
.term-tab .tab-name{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.term-tab .tab-close{font-size:14px;opacity:.5;margin-left:4px;flex-shrink:0}
.term-tab .tab-close:hover{opacity:1;color:var(--red)}
.term-tab .tab-dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0}
.term-tab .tab-dot.on{background:var(--green)}
.term-tab .tab-dot.off{background:var(--red)}
.term-tab-add{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--text2);font-size:18px;margin-left:4px}
.term-tab-add:hover{background:var(--card);color:var(--text1)}
.term-body{flex:1;position:relative;background:#000;overflow:hidden}
.term-body .xterm{height:100%;padding:4px}
.term-picker{position:absolute;top:100%;left:0;margin-top:6px;background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;min-width:220px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.3);z-index:50;overflow:hidden}
.term-picker-head{padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-weight:600}
.term-picker-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 12px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s}
.term-picker-item:hover{background:var(--card)}
.term-picker-dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0}
.term-picker-dot.on{background:#4caf50}
.term-picker-dot.off{background:#666}
.term-picker-name{font-size:13px;color:var(--text1);white-space:nowrap}
.term-picker-addr{font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);margin-left:auto;white-space:nowrap}

.term-empty{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:100%;color:var(--text2);gap:16px}
.term-picker{position:absolute;top:100%;left:0;margin-top:6px;background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;min-width:220px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.3);z-index:50;overflow:hidden}
.term-picker-head{padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-weight:600}
.term-picker-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 12px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s}
.term-picker-item:hover{background:var(--card)}
.term-picker-dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0}
.term-picker-dot.on{background:#4caf50}
.term-picker-dot.off{background:#666}
.term-picker-name{font-size:13px;color:var(--text1);white-space:nowrap}
.term-picker-addr{font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);margin-left:auto;white-space:nowrap}

.term-empty svg{width:64px;height:64px;opacity:.3}
.term-picker{position:absolute;top:100%;left:0;margin-top:6px;background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;min-width:220px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.3);z-index:50;overflow:hidden}
.term-picker-head{padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-weight:600}
.term-picker-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 12px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s}
.term-picker-item:hover{background:var(--card)}
.term-picker-dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0}
.term-picker-dot.on{background:#4caf50}
.term-picker-dot.off{background:#666}
.term-picker-name{font-size:13px;color:var(--text1);white-space:nowrap}
.term-picker-addr{font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);margin-left:auto;white-space:nowrap}

.term-empty p{font-size:14px}

/* ===== File Manager Drawer ===== */
.fm-btn{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--text2);font-size:14px;margin-left:2px;flex-shrink:0}
.fm-btn:hover{background:var(--card);color:var(--text1)}
.fm-drawer{position:absolute;top:0;right:0;width:380px;height:100%;background:var(--bg2);border-left:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;flex-direction:column;z-index:60;box-shadow:-4px 0 24px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}
.fm-header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);flex-shrink:0}
.fm-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text1);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.fm-close{cursor:pointer;color:var(--text2);font-size:18px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px}
.fm-close:hover{background:var(--card);color:var(--text1)}
.fm-path-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;padding:6px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);flex-shrink:0;flex-wrap:wrap}
.fm-path-crumb{font-size:12px;color:var(--accent);cursor:pointer;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px}
.fm-path-crumb:hover{background:var(--card)}
.fm-path-sep{font-size:11px;color:var(--text3)}
.fm-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);flex-shrink:0}
.fm-tbtn{font-size:11px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--text2);border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--card)}
.fm-tbtn:hover{color:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent)}
.fm-tbtn.danger:hover{color:#ef4444;border-color:#ef4444}
.fm-list{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:4px 0}
.fm-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:5px 14px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;color:var(--text1)}
.fm-item:hover{background:var(--card)}
.fm-item.selected{background:rgba(45,212,191,.12)}
.fm-icon{width:16px;height:16px;flex-shrink:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px}
.fm-name{flex:1;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.fm-size{font-size:10px;color:var(--text3);white-space:nowrap}
.fm-empty{text-align:center;padding:40px 20px;color:var(--text3);font-size:12px}
.fm-upload-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);flex-shrink:0}
.fm-upload-label{font-size:11px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid var(--accent);background:transparent}
.fm-upload-label:hover{background:rgba(45,212,191,.1)}
.fm-upload-status{font-size:11px;color:var(--text3)}
.fm-loading{text-align:center;padding:20px;color:var(--text3);font-size:12px}
.term-connecting{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(0,0,0,.85);color:var(--accent);font-size:14px;z-index:5}
</style>
<svg style="display:none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<symbol id="fa-server" viewBox="0 0 640 512"><path fill="currentColor" d="M480 96H160c-8.8 0-16-7.2-16-16s7.2-16 16-16h320c8.8 0 16 7.2 16 16s-7.2 16-16 16zm0 128H160c-8.8 0-16-7.2-16-16s7.2-16 16-16h320c8.8 0 16 7.2 16 16s-7.2 16-16 16zm0 128H160c-8.8 0-16-7.2-16-16s7.2-16 16-16h320c8.8 0 16 7.2 16 16s-7.2 16-16 16zM64 0C28.7 0 0 28.7 0 64v64c0 35.3 28.7 64 64 64h512c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64V64c0-35.3-28.7-64-64-64H64zm0 256c-35.3 0-64 28.7-64 64v64c0 35.3 28.7 64 64 64h512c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64v-64c0-35.3-28.7-64-64-64H64z"/></symbol>
